{
  "info": {
    "name": "AcáNomás API",
    "description": "Colección de escenarios de la API de AcáNomás (D-35): flujos de varios pasos con sesión, como iniciar sesión y editar la ficha. No es el catálogo de endpoints: el detalle de cada uno y la prueba de a uno están en Swagger, en http://localhost:3000/api/docs (D-34). Para probar un endpoint suelto en Postman, importar http://localhost:3000/api/openapi.json (Import > Link).\n\nCómo usarla:\n1. Levantar la base y el backend (ver README).\n2. Importar este archivo en Postman (Import > File).\n3. Para los pedidos del panel, correr primero Cuenta > Iniciar sesión: Postman guarda la cookie de sesión y la manda sola en los pedidos siguientes.\n\nLos pedidos marcados como [Pendiente] todavía no tienen endpoint. Cuando el endpoint está en Swagger, se sacan de acá, salvo que formen parte de un escenario.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "businessSlug", "value": "panaderia-la-espiga", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Salud",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Comprobar que la API responde",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] },
            "description": "Responde 200 con { \"status\": \"ok\" }. No usa la base de datos."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Negocios (público)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Ver la ficha de un negocio",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessSlug}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessSlug}}"]
            },
            "description": "US-08 a US-11. 404 BUSINESS_NOT_FOUND si el slug no existe."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rubros",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Listar rubros",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["categories"] },
            "description": "US-03. Rubros para el filtro del listado."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cuenta",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Registrarse",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"nuevo@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"acanomas123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] },
            "description": "US-12. 409 EMAIL_TAKEN si el email ya existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Iniciar sesión",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner1@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"acanomas123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "US-13. Usa una cuenta del seed. Deja la cookie de sesión, que Postman manda sola en los pedidos siguientes."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Cerrar sesión",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] },
            "description": "US-13. Borra la cookie de sesión."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Ver la sesión actual",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] },
            "description": "US-14. Propuesta en docs/api.md. 401 sin sesión."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Panel del dueño (con sesión)",
      "description": "Correr antes Cuenta > Iniciar sesión. Sin sesión responden 401; sobre un negocio ajeno, 403.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Mis negocios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me/businesses", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me", "businesses"] },
            "description": "US-15 y US-25. Propuesta en docs/api.md. Incluye canales ocultos y el estado con su motivo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Crear la ficha",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["businesses"] },
            "description": "US-15. El cuerpo se define al implementar la historia."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Editar la ficha",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessSlug}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessSlug}}"]
            },
            "description": "US-15 a US-18. El cuerpo se define al implementar cada historia."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Subir la foto",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [{ "key": "photo", "type": "file", "src": [] }] },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessSlug}}/photo",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessSlug}}", "photo"]
            },
            "description": "US-19. Propuesta en docs/api.md. JPG, PNG o WebP de hasta 5 MB."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Guardar el horario semanal",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessSlug}}/opening-hours",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessSlug}}", "opening-hours"]
            },
            "description": "US-21 y US-22. Reemplaza el horario completo. El cuerpo se define al implementar la historia."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Marcar hoy no abro",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessSlug}}/closed-today",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessSlug}}", "closed-today"]
            },
            "description": "US-23. Propuesta en docs/api.md."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Quitar hoy no abro",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessSlug}}/closed-today",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessSlug}}", "closed-today"]
            },
            "description": "US-23. Propuesta en docs/api.md."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Pausar el negocio",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessSlug}}/pause",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessSlug}}", "pause"]
            },
            "description": "US-24. Propuesta en docs/api.md."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Pendiente] Reactivar el negocio",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessSlug}}/pause",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessSlug}}", "pause"]
            },
            "description": "US-24. Propuesta en docs/api.md."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
